      "description": "Everyone else in town"
    }
  },
  "text": {
    "public": "Late at night, smoke pours out of the flats above the market. {trapped} is still inside. The whole town is in the street: {neighbours}.",
    "private": {
      "trapped": "The stairs are full of smoke. Through the window you can see everyone you have met in this town looking up at you.",
      "neighbours": "{trapped} is at the upstairs window. The fire brigade is ten minutes away."
    }
  },
  "choices": {
